<title>UK: Two Brent dates kept, one clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Two Brent dates kept, one clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of the three Brent cargoes to be nominated from the paper chain were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline on Wednesday and one was clocked, traders said.</p>
<p>BP and Vitol kept their nominations and Texaco was clocked after a dispute, they added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
